.TH SDL_DestroyEnvironment 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_DestroyEnvironment \- Destroy a set of environment variables.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_stdinc.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_DestroyEnvironment(SDL_Environment *env);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I env
the environment to destroy\[char46]
.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread, as long as the environment is no longer in use\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

